      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "1. Welcome to the Game! By playing Ready-Set-Bag!, you agree to these
    Terms and Conditions. This game is designed to help you learn how to properly
    prepare an emergency go-bag while having fun.\r\n2. Playing Modes\r\n  \u2022<indent=48>Offline
    / Practice Mode: Any scores, progress, and unlocked levels achieved while playing
    offline are stored locally on your device.</indent>\r\n  \u2022<indent=48>Classroom
    Mode: When entering a 5-letter room code provided by your teacher, your gameplay
    results, scores, and go-bag items will be shared to your teacher's dashboard
    for academic and tracking purposes.</indent>\r\n3. Student Data & Privacy\r\n 
    \u2022<indent=48>We respect your privacy. The game only collects gameplay data
    (such as your scores and item selections) necessary for your school activities
    and teacher assessments.</indent>\r\n  \u2022<indent=48>Your data is used solely
    for educational purposes related to this research project and will not be shared
    with outside commercial parties.</indent>\r\n4. Acceptable Use\r\n  \u2022<indent=48>Play
    fairly, do not attempt to hack or exploit the room code system, and enjoy learning
    emergency preparedness at your own pace!</indent>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cb9e1039b0a3b8246bd89a8ec45dc46c, type: 2}
